                <p class="text-white font-bold mb-1">Penetrating Silane-Siloxane for minor moisture; Crystalline for active leaks</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">No penetrating sealer stops hydrostatic pressure. For active seepage, address drainage first. Crystalline waterproofing (Xypex, Kryton) is the right product for persistent basement moisture.</p>
